t></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"model\" transform=\"translate(440 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">多曲线回归</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">学习泥质相关偏差</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"baseline\" transform=\"translate(440 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f4efe4\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">固定密度公式</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">骨架与流体密度明示</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-node=\"gate\" data-flow-step=\"2\"><polygon points=\"735,20 800,65 735,110 670,65\" fill=\"#fbf0d9\"/><text x=\"735\" y=\"71\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">输入与场景是否对应？差异需要人工复核吗？</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"review\" transform=\"translate(670 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f6eade\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">沿井深看残差</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">定位高低估的深度</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"output\" transform=\"translate(880 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">孔隙度与误差</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">百分点RMSE和MAE</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"compare\" transform=\"translate(880 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">留出孔隙度对照</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">120个独立测试点</text></g>\n </svg></div><figcaption>详细原理、数据图表与计算见下方各步骤。<span data-flow-instruction></span></figcaption></figure><article class=\"workflow-step flow-step\" data-step=\"0\"><h3>1. 组织标定与留出</h3><p>独立种子生成训练标定点和120测试点。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 95\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"组织标定与留出的输入动作与产物\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"16\" width=\"250\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e7efea\"/><path d=\"M270 43H340l-10-7m10 7l-10 7\" stroke=\"#14796f\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"352\" y=\"16\" width=\"398\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f7f1e6\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#243740\">组织标定与留出</text><text x=\"369\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#243740\">不重叠的标定与测试</text></svg><p><b>产物：</b>不重叠的标定与测试</p><p class=\"sub\">注意：孔隙度不放进预测输入。</p></article><article class=\"workflow-step flow-step\" data-step=\"1\"><h3>2. 拟合与公式对照</h3><p>多曲线岭回归对照固定密度公式。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 95\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"拟合与公式对照的输入动作与产物\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"16\" width=\"250\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e7efea\"/><path d=\"M270 43H340l-10-7m10 7l-10 7\" stroke=\"#14796f\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"352\" y=\"16\" width=\"398\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f7f1e6\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#243740\">拟合与公式对照</text><text x=\"369\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#243740\">预测孔隙度与系数</text></svg><p><b>产物：</b>预测孔隙度与系数</p><p class=\"sub\">注意：骨架和流体密度假设明示。</p></article><article class=\"workflow-step flow-step\" data-step=\"2\"><h3>3. 检查误差位置</h3><p>计算RMSE、MAE和逐点残差。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 95\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"检查误差位置的输入动作与产物\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"16\" width=\"250\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e7efea\"/><path d=\"M270 43H340l-10-7m10 7l-10 7\" stroke=\"#14796f\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"352\" y=\"16\" width=\"398\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f7f1e6\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#243740\">检查误差位置</text><text x=\"369\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#243740\">百分点误差与交会图</text></svg><p><b>产物：</b>百分点误差与交会图</p><p class=\"sub\">注意：相关性好不代表所有点误差小。</p></article>"
